    }
};
```
Here, we check if the current root node is full. If it's not, we simply add the data point there. Otherwise, we first create new empty child nodes and then move existing data points to these new nodes. This process is recursive for each level of the tree until a leaf node can accommodate the data point without overflowing its capacity.

